---
// Slide 20: CLIO's architecture and where SPOTTER-AI plugs in.
---
<figure class="clio">
  <div class="fronts"><span>🖥 Desktop</span><span>🌐 Web</span><span>⌨ CLI · REST</span></div>
  <div class="mid">
    <div class="agent"><strong>CLIO agent</strong><span>orchestrator · flows (react, plan, …) · subagents · plugins</span></div>
    <div class="side"><strong>Models</strong><span>local, provider account, or lab service (e.g. vLLM)</span></div>
    <div class="gw">
      <strong>MCP tool gateway</strong>
      <div class="tools"><span>HDF5</span><span>Parquet</span><span>CSV</span><span>plots</span></div>
      <div class="sp"><strong>SPOTTER-AI</strong>: provenance + attention: heat maps for any selected span of an answer</div>
    </div>
    <div class="side mem"><strong>ARC memory</strong><span>conversations, tool invocations, context</span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="banner2"><strong>SPOTTER-AI in CLIO:</strong> read the Flowcept record and the SafeTensors attention, aggregate it for the selected span, and paint the heat map over every prompt of the session.</div>
</figure>

<style>
  .clio { margin: 0; max-width: 860px; }
  .fronts { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 10px; max-width: 560px; }
  .fronts span { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; font-weight: 700; background: var(--panel); }
  .mid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 220px; gap: 12px; margin-top: 12px; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .mid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .fronts { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
  .agent { background: #1b2a3a; border: 1px solid #46607a; border-radius: 10px; padding: 18px; text-align: center; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; }
  .agent strong { font-size: 1.15rem; } .agent span, .side span { color: var(--muted); font-size: .86rem; }
  .side { border: 1.5px solid #46607a; border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; text-align: center; gap: 4px; }
  .side.mem { border-color: #4ea3e8; }
  .gw { background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; }
  .tools { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 8px; margin: 10px 0; }
  .tools span { text-align: center; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 6px; padding: 6px; font-size: .85rem; }
  .sp { border: 2px dashed #d8b444; background: #2a2510; border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: .88rem; }
  .sp strong { color: #f0d27a; }
  .banner2 { margin-top: 14px; background: #0a3a3a; border-left: 6px solid #19b8a6; border-radius: 8px; padding: 12px 16px; font-size: .95rem; }
  .banner2 strong { color: #4fe0c8; }
</style>
